# The punch-ins: REPEAT (FX + white 4) with its division on the black keys, LOW/HIGH PASS sweeps, THROW.
# (Their sound is checked by ear and by tests/fm1 analysis; this runs them and checks the messages.)
wait 300
demo 1
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 1500

wait 1000
press FX
key 6 down
wait 1500
key 6 up
release FX
wait 800
press FX
key 6 down
wait 600
key 1 down
wait 50
expect msg REPEAT 1/16
key 1 up
wait 900
key 6 up
release FX
wait 800
press FX
key 11 down
wait 1500
key 11 up
release FX
wait 800
press FX
key 7 down
wait 2200
key 7 up
release FX
wait 300
press FX
key 9 down
wait 2200
key 9 up
release FX
